        <h1>
          <span class=3D"m-breadcrumb"><a href=3D"https://doc.magnum.graphi=
cs/magnum/features.html">Feature guide</a> =C2=BB</span>
          Using the scene graph
        </h1>
        <p>Overview of scene management capabilities.</p>
        <nav class=3D"m-block m-default">
          <h3>Contents</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><a href=3D"https://doc.magnum.graphics/magnum/scenegraph.ht=
